vyrol0r7SKGL2Ky_tnzZChe94MixAnAOtTHB23DleXAz8LwvCdAAua071JmLbZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft09TjzMFS3N6bRLp4ZGt1w9ibNKsAHYHEpD02eFtY7eg&oe=699D8D3B"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates03cropped.png", "id": "337914812432265", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974774_337914815765598_1762840369253842605_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LzuW-lye6P0Q7kNvwHFcw8u&_nc_oc=Adlxb3ivbMxwdwSruvcJnZEte6iCqx-GMAh1KslZ8vFP_unwWgftkkd8z2AeFdHNGEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftWjdUBpRpScUX2hNcEaEYd8Rz7vr10jpVDYu-Hjx6GnQ&oe=699D87A1"}, {"file_name": "VRShogiMates04cropped.png", "id": "367552249204365", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_367552252537698_6058304213158592905_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tes1D84qTsoQ7kNvwGlzUus&_nc_oc=AdlVA1gqCPwsYAIe-h31ZgUJ2gVdkep8tav9oJNyJoxy9I8BQOQHF8YV2rQPH5dF67g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvfkSWFJvK6TwvfXLPXPjnTaHLg5trd7Q9PwaBOTA5ZMw&oe=699DB625"}, {"file_name": "Chess cropped.png", "id": "902765531159168", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_902765534492501_3956653358745274292_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJGizaMhUoAQ7kNvwGhfHyF&_nc_oc=AdkD9F3m8QQcAk-CT2VP_EPjnql17NcpYX0g3q8OOqxY8Z18JTQJ7MH0XZYEFrY9u38&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftgmD4rs7xzK8JXsQ_K3OEY8kyh4ShxIy4Sk5P4EVI7Zw&oe=699DB123"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerScreenshot cropped.png", "id": "717849803637730", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982545_717849806971063_8753740338935084738_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O3jeS62jvd4Q7kNvwFDVdLs&_nc_oc=Adl07mtQ1XRi5i_SnODq3MuaGAXhoa1qXHQZi-frtOeOM50qmlcTpuPcnXeA2v2wA1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu0ycWshW_gHfdi_Vmj-I4gwyvVpG8jFbeloR8c-7t6sw&oe=699D92BB"}, "display_name": "VRShogiMates", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to VRShogiMates, your gateway to a captivating virtual realm of classic board games! As a solo developer's passion project, this app delivers an unparalleled experience featuring Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and the unique Gungi from Hunter X Hunter.\n\nMultiplayer Mode:\nChallenge opponents worldwide in real-time or correspondence matches. Whether facing friends or discovering new adversaries, the global multiplayer functionality ensures a dynamic and engaging experience.\n\nHow to play:\nNew to these intricate games? No problem! VRShogiMates provides comprehensive rules, instructions, and a game record for each game type to help you learn. Explore the rules, grasp essential strategies, and elevate your skills!\n\nRegular Updates and Support:\nMy commitment doesn't end at launch. Expect continuous updates, bug fixes, performance enhancements, and exciting new features driven by valuable feedback from us.\n\nUnique Highlights:\nVenture into the unexplored VR realms of Shogi, Chu Shogi, Xiangqi, and Gungi - experiences currently not offered by any other VR app on the market! The last game type, Gungi, brings a touch of fantasy to your gaming repertoire. It\u2019s refreshingly different from other board games, check it out!\n\nEmbark on this virtual journey, where tradition meets innovation, and every move is a step towards victory. VRShogiMates is not just a game; it's a portal to a world where strategy, competition, and community converge. Join us and redefine your board gaming experience!", "short_description": "Dive into the immersive world of board games with VRShogiMates! Play Shogi, Chu Shogi, Chess, Xiangqi, and Gungi in a stunning virtual environment. Challenge friends globally in real-time or turn-based multiplayer. Learn the rules for all the games, while enjoying regular updates for an ever-evolving gaming experience.\n\nInternet connection is required to play. (For now)\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develop